    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "For Singles, round 1 is usually paired at random. Later rounds can be paired many ways; the recommended criteria, in order:\n\n1. win, loss and draw record, e.g. 2 players at 3–1 meet\n2. win path: when in the event each win and loss came\n3. at random among players with the same ranking",
